the evil unto mine enemies: destroy thou them in thy truth.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"With a freewill offering will I sacrifice unto thee: I will give thanks unto thy name, O LORD, for it is good.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"For he hath delivered me out of all trouble; and mine eye hath seen my desire upon mine enemies.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_rv5/PSA/54.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_rv5/PSA/55.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_rv5/PSA/53.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}